I am in the living room.
The front door of my house is open.
Asha knocks gently on the open door.
I look towards the door.
Asha is standing near the door.
There are two cups in her hands.
She asks, "Maya, may I come in?"
I say, "Yes Asha, come in."
Asha comes inside the house.
There is hot tea in the cups.
There is a small table in the living room.
Asha places the tea cups on that table.
She says, "I have placed the tea on the table."
She says further, "Take a rest for a short while now."
I smile and say, "Thank you very much."
Asha sits on the sofa near the table.
I sit on the nearby chair.
We drink the hot tea.
I feel very nice in the new house now.
